WEBVTT

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.410
You've lost track of them?

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.240
Both collection and delivery 
are behind schedule.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:50.450
I've received word that Lag, Zazie, and 
Connor have not appeared at their scheduled towns.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.370
Lag was supposed to have gone to 
Blue Notes Blues to investigate,

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.340
but Zazie and Connor are also to the north?

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.740
As I thought.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.910
So, the series of robberies to the south

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:08.230
was nothing but a distraction tactic by Reverse after all.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:13.220
Their true goal is to try 
something in the north.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:18.460
In that area, the city with the 
highest population is Lament.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:25.620
That city has Veritably Abbey and is 
passionately faithful to the Empress.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:30.350
There's a prayer hill called the 
"Angel's Wing," for instance.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.350
I wish I could send someone,

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.090
but I don't have anyone to spare.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.500
Cabernet Attacks

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.910
This world will soon be saved.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.660
And we will sacrifice 
ourselves for that cause.

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:18.470
I'm sorry, Abbess... I'll head 
to Angel's Wing right away.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.450
That will not provide a 
strong enough flavor, Sunny.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.670
Put this in the cookies.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.650
Magical Tattoo leaves?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.520
But they're a deadly poison...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.900
You deliver these cookies to a Bee, yes?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:44.100
The Letter Bees are the fingers 
of the government, our enemies.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.830
We cannot have them 
interfering with our plan.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.590
You'll do this, Sunny, yes?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.350
Exactly as you said.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.120
Quite a roundabout method...

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:08.970
If we make a ruckus, the other 
townspeople will notice.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:23.450
Will the two of them be okay alone?

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:39.990
I know, Gus... He said 
to keep a lookout, right?

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.250
But...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:44.020
Hey, just listen to me. Connor!

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:47.260
That Abbey is a hideout for Reverse...

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.720
That can't be!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:56.730
A girl as pretty and nice as her could 
never do things like steal letters!

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.490
...of course it isn't Reverse!

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:05.410
That cute girl who bakes such yummy cookies?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.600
Huh?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.560
Gus!

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.000
Wait, Gus!

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.720
There's an underground complex like this?

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.780
What is Reverse planning?

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.020
You're...

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.900
W-We finally meet again!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.840
A Letter Bee!

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.260
Don't!

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:50.070
Lag, it's her! She's the one that...

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.590
Wait... Your clothes?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.620
Don't look! I have a reason...

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.460
C-Cute...

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:01.460
Wait!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:08.050
Connor, she's with Reverse. 
She's together with Noir.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:17.330
With this all destroyed, you can write 
any report to Akatsuki you want.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:21.400
If it goes according to plan, 
Akatsuki will be no more.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.740
It's a lie, right? That 
girl... a member of Reverse?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:43.100
But, but... She's so cute!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.520
It's the truth, okay! Anyway, run!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.320
Sunny...

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:21.750
Are those my usual cookies?

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.190
Thank you.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.620
Your cookies really are delicious, Sunny.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.290
Somehow a little spicier than usual...

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:39.740
Mr. Connor?

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.280
I met her...

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:47.650
The girl you bought cookies 
from the first time?

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:51.370
But she was a member of Reverse!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.240
Is it really true? Was 
it just how Zazie said?

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:02.500
But Zazie said it wasn't just 
her... It was the entire Abbey...

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:08.170
Huh? My hands... are going numb...

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.990
I'm sorry, Mr. Connor... I'm...

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:21.810
Another abandoned child... It can't be helped.
Treat her as a blessing from the Empress.

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:26.580
Even in poverty, we must 
work and give thanks.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:29.220
Because this is your house.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.850
Give...thanks?

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:36.190
How dirty! Stay away, you abbey brat!

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.700
How long are you going to cry, Sunny?

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:43.060
It's your own fault you didn't 
collect any donations.

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.830
Pray, Sunny!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.840
But...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.200
What is the matter?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.700
I don't know what I should pray for.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:09:00.840
The town is poor... We collect 
only enough money to live...

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:06.400
I don't even know what in the 
world I should pray for anymore...

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:17.250
Not even a single slice of bread again today!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.990
But can we complain? No...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:28.500
With this, we will no longer have to worry about 
food, fuel, or the money to fix the broken walls.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:32.550
They will assist us with everything!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.800
The government and their 
wretched policies are to blame!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:42.270
Reverse will return things to the 
proper way, faithful to the Empress.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.720
We want to reform the world.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.770
Reverse...

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:51.520
It's the same thing that you seek, yes?

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:55.070
You will save this world.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.250
Reverse was revered by everyone like gods...

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.940
But I couldn't think of them the same way.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.090
However, one day...

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.290
Cookies, please!

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.740
A Letter Bee! The enemies of Reverse!

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.900
Huh? Where is the girl from yesterday?

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:20.020
She is not here today. Baking 
cookies is my job, you see.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:25.470
Huh, it is? Well, I'll take 
3 bags of each, for now.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:27.370
Sure...

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.440
Here.

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:38.820
Yum!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:43.210
Hey, was it you who made these cookies?

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.080
Yes...

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:50.390
Really? That's amazing! They're really good.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:12.480
I won't let you interfere.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.570
I don't know what you intend to do.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.850
But I'm going to stop you!

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:20.200
How?

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.320
You don't even have your gun.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:26.840
Give it back! That's Gauche's Nocturne!

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.690
Gauche is no longer here.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.050
He had his heart stolen 
in the capital, Akatsuki!

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:36.670
Don't you people in Reverse steal the heart 
in people's precious letters as well?

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:39.020
It's over.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.760
Hands off my cutey-pie!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.570
Tee-hee.

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.600
Zazie?

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.620
I came to save you, little kitty.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:57.780
Zazie, why are you here?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:03.050
I left Wasiolka to handle 
reporting to the Bee Hive.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.030
You know, without me around...

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.620
You prefer wearing a skirt, Lala-chan?

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.660
Oh, lay off it, Zazie.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.710
Okay, blast 'em, shotgun!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.300
Blue Thorn!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:21.330
Lala-chan, have you finished changing yet?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.970
I-I'm finished!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.970
There!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.650
Okay... How about you tell me everything?

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.340
About Reverse's plan...

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.040
It's arrived?

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:03.670
That!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.930
I saw it in Noir's memories!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.550
That's the gaichuu that 
Niche's sister had sealed!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.150
Gaichuu Cabernet.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.480
It will consume the light of the capital.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:16.890
Roda.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:21.140
You said that human sacrifices 
will save the world...

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.190
By human sacrifices, you don't mean...

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:29.000
You don't mean you intend to let that gaichuu 
eat the hearts of the people in the Abbey, right?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.670
Cabernet will grow even larger 
after it sucks up heart.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.330
I will never let you do that!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:45.380
I wanted to see you, Gauche.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.670
I am the Marauder Noir.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:52.640
If you continue to get in 
Reverse's way, I will rob you...

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.640
...of your life.

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.700
Why are you working so hard for Reverse?

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:04.900
The light in the capital will vanish, and 
everything will begin again from true darkness.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.900
That is what my heart tells me.

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:13.240
Are you not going to cry today?

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:16.750
With the letter bullet...

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:19.240
The letter bullet is...

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:22.270
I knew this was something important.

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:24.960
Roda!

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.020
Shindan loaded...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.410
Raven Black!

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.930
Gus? Huh? What happened to me?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.720
That noise... A gaichuu?

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.610
Sunny...

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.860
Sunny!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.820
He neutralized it?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.550
Get it together, Lag!

00:14:57.550 --> 00:15:00.650
It's no use, Zazie... The letter bullet is...

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:04.170
In that case, I'll blast 
some Blue Thorns into 'im.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:05.550
But that's...

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:08.010
Fine, then I'll cover you.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.510
Thank you, Zazie.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:12.760
Run, Lag!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.370
Roda, get down.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:21.420
Take this... Rain of Blue Thorns!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:27.080
Somewhere deep inside of Noir, 
Gauche Suede still exists.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.900
I believe that I can reach Gauche's heart.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:32.800
Like the way I shot into 
Niche's sister's heart.

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.030
My entire heart...

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.900
...to Gauche's heart!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.200
Nocturne Op. 20!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.560
Resound, Red Needle!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.700
Noir!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:47.960
Remember!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.050
Gauche!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.420
The two of us...

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.490
...traveled together.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:03.850
It's because of that time that I decided 
to become a Letter Bee just like you.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:17.200
The Cabernet is listening to our prayers.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.890
Abbess, those are...

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:45.560
Mr. Connor, I am sorry. 
I am a member of Reverse.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.850
I treated your cookies with a medicine 
that numbs your body for a little while.

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.100
It isn't a deadly poison.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:56.950
I didn't want to put you 
in danger, Mr. Connor.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.940
I will become a sacrifice.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:08.080
They told me from the beginning it was to make 
Amberground a better place, but I don't really know.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.680
Sunny!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.900
But, I met you, Mr. Connor.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:28.560
Yummy... I really love your cookies, Sunny.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.850
I love you too...

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:34.700
Huh?

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.950
No, I mean...

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:46.790
I love it when people look 
happy after eating them, yes!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:18:01.010
I wished for everyone to be able to be 
happy... For you to always be happy, Mr. Connor...

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:24.280
Sunny... Your heart...

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:29.850
I finally found something 
to pray to the Empress for!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:38.800
If you were to grant my wish... 
Please be it for my first love...

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:45.900
Give back Sunny's heart!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.310
Give it back!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.010
Dammit!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.400
To me, Mr. Connor, you are my...

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.840
Lag...

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.940
Gauche!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:40.960
Next: Light Shines on the Darkness
